<h1><span data-field="title" data-format="default">dbg_view_exists</span></h1>
<p>This function returns whether the given custom debug view, created with <span class="inline3_func"><a href="dbg_view.htm">dbg_view</a></span>, still exists.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Syntax:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-field="title" data-format="default">dbg_view_exists</span>(view)</p>
<table>
<colgroup>
<col/>
<col/>
<col/>
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Argument</th>
<th>Type</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>view</td>
<td><span data-keyref="Type_Pointer_DebugView"><a target="_blank" href="dbg_view.htm">Debug View Pointer</a></span></td>
<td>A pointer to a debug view returned by a call to <span class="inline3_func"><a href="dbg_view.htm">dbg_view</a></span>.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p> </p>
<h4>Returns:</h4>
<p class="code"><span data-keyref="Type_Bool"><a target="_blank" href="../../GML_Overview/Data_Types.htm">Boolean</a></span></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Example:</h4>
<p class="code">view = dbg_view(&quot;View 1&quot;, true);<br/>
show_debug_message(<span data-field="title" data-format="default">dbg_view_exists</span>(view));<br/>
dbg_view_delete(view);<br/>
show_debug_message(<span data-field="title" data-format="default">dbg_view_exists</span>(view));</p>
<p>The above code first creates a new debug view using <span class="inline3_func"><a href="dbg_view.htm">dbg_view</a></span> and stores the pointer to it in a variable <span class="inline2">view</span>. <span class="inline3_func"><span data-field="title" data-format="default">dbg_view_exists</span></span> is called a first time to check if the debug view stored in <span class="inline2">view</span> exists and the result is output using <span class="inline3_func"><a href="show_debug_message.htm">show_debug_message</a></span>. The view is then deleted with a call to <span class="inline3_func"><a href="dbg_view_delete.htm">dbg_view_delete</a></span>. At this point, the variable <span class="inline2">view</span> still holds a pointer to a debug view, but the debug view doesn&#39;t exist anymore and the pointer has become invalid. <span class="inline3_func"><span data-field="title" data-format="default">dbg_view_exists</span></span> is called a second time and its return value output in a debug message.</p>
<p> </p>
